{"about_the_game":"Sunlight is a short, vibrant and thought captivating exploration game, from the creators of Among the Sleep, Mosaic and The Plan. Journey into the uncharted forest, guided by the harmonised whispers of the trees. Each tree with different voices, genders and dialects, speaking as one.<br> <br>Taking artistic inspiration from expressionist painters like Monet and Munch and focusing on a powerful 3D audio experience with breath-taking choir work, Sunlight will leave you feeling entranced and in wonder in this artistic approach to telling you a story.<br> <br>Playtime: 30 minutes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451120/extras/1973c3b8426e53b6c80a03e09f3d64d8.poster.avif?t=1770404875\" width=600 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451120/extras/1973c3b8426e53b6c80a03e09f3d64d8.webm?t=1770404875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451120/extras/1973c3b8426e53b6c80a03e09f3d64d8.mp4?t=1770404875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The visuals, that were hand painted using Quill, makes the experience feel like exploring a three dimensional painting.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451120/extras/aa9504faf21a2128d0195c17762b3389.avif?t=1770404875\" width=600 height=224 /></span><br><br>The hauntingly beautiful music, composed by Tchaikovsky, was recorded in the Archbishops palace in Trondheim, Norway, and sung by the award winning choir Kammerkoret Aurum. Along with a wide range of voice actors spanning multiple continents, the atmospheric and meditative story comes alive.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451120/extras/c09cc728fdd0a9e6a5bef008b287e09f.avif?t=1770404875\" width=600 height=224 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1451120?t=1770404875","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451120/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770404875","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451120/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770404875","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451120/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770404875","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>One tree planted for every download</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451120/extras/bea94531179a7db24c3706aac6bb5145.avif?t=1770404875\" width=650 height=196 /></span><br>Everything is connected, and Sunlight is no different.\u00a0For every copy of the game that is downloaded, a tree will be planted. Read more\u00a0about the\u00a0climate project on Sunlight's\u00a0Ecologi\u00a0page.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Sunlight is a short, vibrant and thought captivating exploration game, from the creators of Among the Sleep, Mosaic and The Plan. Journey into the uncharted forest, guided by the harmonised whispers of the trees. Each tree with different voices, genders and dialects, speaking as one.<br> <br>Taking artistic inspiration from expressionist painters like Monet and Munch and focusing on a powerful 3D audio experience with breath-taking choir work, Sunlight will leave you feeling entranced and in wonder in this artistic approach to telling you a story.<br> <br>Playtime: 30 minutes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451120/extras/1973c3b8426e53b6c80a03e09f3d64d8.poster.avif?t=1770404875\" width=600 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451120/extras/1973c3b8426e53b6c80a03e09f3d64d8.webm?t=1770404875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451120/extras/1973c3b8426e53b6c80a03e09f3d64d8.mp4?t=1770404875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The visuals, that were hand painted using Quill, makes the experience feel like exploring a three dimensional painting.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451120/extras/aa9504faf21a2128d0195c17762b3389.avif?t=1770404875\" width=600 height=224 /></span><br><br>The hauntingly beautiful music, composed by Tchaikovsky, was recorded in the Archbishops palace in Trondheim, Norway, and sung by the award winning choir Kammerkoret Aurum. Along with a wide range of voice actors spanning multiple continents, the atmospheric and meditative story comes alive.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451120/extras/c09cc728fdd0a9e6a5bef008b287e09f.avif?t=1770404875\" width=600 height=224 /></span>","developers":["Krillbite Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st